      },
      "natural_statement": "For every smooth complex Fano X of pseudoindex at least two, every numerical beta represented by a nonconstant free map, and every very ample H=-aK_X, the numerical-degree point descendant <tau_(d-2)(pt)>_beta is at least (a*d)^(-(d-1)).",
