      "natural_statement": "For every smooth connected complex projective X with -K_X.C>=2 on every irreducible rational curve, every very ample H and every numerical beta with a nonconstant free representative, <tau_(d-2)(pt)>_beta>=b^(-(d-1)), where d=-K_X.beta and b=H.beta.",
