      "natural_statement": "The retained Jacobian matrix for weights (2,4,6) has transformation-certified Smith factors (1,2,12), coarse torus degree 24, generic stabilizer order 2, and stack degree 48. The boundary dimension gap after delta=2+s, u=1+t, d=d0+delta*u+r is exactly 1+s+t+s*t+r. The accompanying finite tree, chart, stabilizer and weight tests pass; none purports to machine-check virtual geometry.",
